{"asset_key":"mn2/gameplay_story_10604050","episode":"mn2","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10604050","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1060405001:1":{"text":"이렇게 초라한 모습을 보여 너무 죄송하군요.","source_cn":"让你看见这么狼狈的一面，真是抱歉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC13E67D226118201","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1060405002:1":{"text":"저희가 적을 너무 얕잡아 보고 제대로 조사도 하지 않은 채 행동을 하는 바람에... 이곳에 고블린이 이렇게 많을 줄은 몰랐어요.","source_cn":"是我们太轻敌了，没调查清楚就贸然行动……没想到这里居然...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84C4E8B6F0F1C9FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1060405003:1":{"text":"당신을 만나서 다행이에요. 순찰대가 올 때까지 기다리려면 저희는 아마 진작에 패배하고 말았을 거예요.","source_cn":"幸好遇到了你。要是真的等到巡逻队过来，我们估计早就败下...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA514531E9D6C3D0E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1060405004:1":{"text":"이건 감사 인사로 드리는 거니, 꼭 받아주세요.","source_cn":"这一点东西算是感谢，请你务必收下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x421F026B7BD4D62B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:薄暮队员德兰克":{"text":"땅거미 대원 딜런","source":"薄暮队员德兰克","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}